" &#64;BuildStep UnremovableBeanBuildItem unremovable() { // A bean whose bean class FQCN is equal to org.acme.MyService is considered unremovable return new UnremovableBeanBuildItem(new BeanClassNameExclusion(\"org.acme.MyService\")); }\n"
"```\n"
"--"
