"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"Make it possible to add, remove or alter annotations on various components. The provided transformer uses `AnnotationsTransformer#appliesTo(AnnotationTarget.Kind)` to limit the scope of transformer to classes, fields, methods, method params or a combination of those. These metadata changes are not stored in Jandex directly (Jandex is immutable) but instead in an abstraction layer. Users/extensions can access `AnnotationStore` to view the updated annotation model. NOTE: Extensions that operate purely on Jandex index analysis won't be able to see any changes made via `AnnotationsTransformer` !\n"
"--"
msgstr "link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/blob/main/extensions/resteasy-reactive/rest/spi-deployment/src/main/java/io/quarkus/resteasy/reactive/server/spi/AnnotationsTransformerBuildItem.java[io.quarkus.resteasy.reactive.server.spi.AnnotationsTransformerBuildItem]"

